# Global CODEOWNERS file for .github organization configuration
# These rules apply as defaults across repositories that don't override them,
# or you can adapt them for your primary repositories.

# 1. Global Default Owner
# Catches everything in the repository unless overridden below.
* @your-username

# 2. CI/CD Workflows & Automation
# Ensures changes to pipeline configurations require explicit review.
.github/workflows/ @your-username
.github/CODEOWNERS @your-username

# 3. Documentation & Guides
# Assigns documentation updates to a specific person or team (if applicable).
/docs/ @your-username
*.md @your-username

# 4. Dependency & Package Configuration
# Protects core setup files from unvetted changes.
/package.json @your-username
/pnpm-lock.yaml @your-username
/package-lock.json @your-username
/yarn.lock @your-username
